corresponderende kleuren.<br> Gebruik de regel:  \((a+b)(c+d)=ac+ad+bc+bd) : <p>
\if{\step=1}{ <small>Gebruik de blauwe vakjes om de berekening af te maken.</small> <p>
   \(\enonce1= \t1\po\t0) \embed{r1,\size2} \(\t1\pf\t0\times \t3\po\t0) \embed{r2,\size2} \(\t3\pf\t0 + \t1\po\t0) \embed{r3,\size2} \(\t1\pf\t0 \times \t4\po\t0 ) \embed{r4,\size2} \(\t4\pf\t0 + \t2\po\t0) \embed{r5,\size2} \(\t2\pf\t0 \times \t3\po\t0 ) \embed{r6,\size2} \(\t3\pf\t0 + \t2\po\t0) \embed{r7,\size2} \(\t2\pf\t0 \times \t4\po\t0 ) \embed{r8,\size2} \(\t4\pf\t0) 
}{
<table border=0>
<tr>\ligne1</tr>
<tr>
\if{\step=2}{
